## Executive Summary

This revision (file labelled H7 but incorporating the H8-stage corrections identified in the prior review) is a **further substantial improvement**. The authors have corrected the major numerical errors from the previous round: ρ_max = 2.110 × 10⁹⁶ kg m⁻³ and 9.095 × 10⁷⁵ GeV⁴ are now correct in the Abstract, §6.1, and Appendix G; M_rem = 2.38 × 10⁻⁸ kg is now correct in Table H.1; the Appendix C factor of 2 is fixed (8π²r⁴/15ℏc); the S_Araki estimate is now O(10⁻⁷) nats (still worth double-checking); Appendix E now correctly states O(ℓ_Pl²/r_+) = O(ℏ/(Mc)); Appendix F now shows the derivation of the factor of 2 in σ_r; Eq. (4.1) is largely fixed; the BKM metric is now relaxation-weighted; and epistemic badges ([Status: ...]) have been added throughout.

